  "tests": "tests/test_manifold.py::test_value_neighbour_chord_on_nonmonotone_ring, ::test_arc_aim_fraction_along_fitted_curve",
  "stored_files_from_ungated_code": "none in results/ (the ungated chord ran only in scratch box dirs coord_L12_s{1..16}; the landed results/arcs_rawchord_fixed/ files use aim='arc', whose code path the gating did not change: reruns arcg_L12_s{4,7} are identical to 0.0)"
